        Isle("Choir Deep",6,"Monday Shoal","Oli Ninepins, calendar keeper",
            "A coral colony here rings once for every sunset. The hospital children have woven a calendar around it. It has rung twice on the same evening, and a girl named Dess is being asked to have her birthday again.",
            "A calendar bead shaped like a small cake",
            Crossing("monday-count",D.Hunt,"The Second Sunset",
                "Dess is willing to have another cake. She is less willing to turn ten twice. She insists on joining the search for the second bell.",
                "Trace the answering chime through the evening shoals.","Afterbell Tortoise",
