                "Calendar Limpet","Freed of the ring, the turtle puts its head away six times. Dess decides a traveler may observe as many evenings as circumstances require.",6,
                At(A.Brace,S.West,"Shell sling","Brace the shell sling below the coral"),
                At(A.Cut,S.Crane,"Old harpoon ring","Cut the ring without touching the calendar chip"),
