                "Keep the cake tender upright through the outer choir.","Crumbjaw",
                "The case goes out full and comes back full. Each crew has slipped a different present inside for a girl who gave away a birthday.",7,J.Tow,J.Relieve,J.Guide),
            Landfall("monday-gift","Room for Tomorrow",
